spans.s:
सङ्-कोचन, अम्, n. the act of contracting or
shrinking, contraction, causing to shrink or close;
astringing; (अस्, ई, अम्), contracting, shrinking;
astringent; (ई), f. the sensitive plant (= लज्जालु).

सङ्-क्लेद, अस्, m. wet, wetness, moisture, damp;
the fluid secretion which is supposed to form upon
conception and become the rudiment of the fetus.

सङ्-क्षेपण, अम्, n. the act of throwing or
heaping together; abridgement, brevity, abbreviation;
sending; taking away.

. only A.) -क्ष्णुते,
-क्ष्णवितुम्, to sharpen well or thoroughly, sharpen;
to excite, intensify.

1. सङ्-गर, अस्, m. agreeing together, agree-
ment, assent; promise; a bargain, transaction of sale;
knowledge.

2. सङ्-गर, अस्, m. swallowing up, devouring,
misfortune, calamity; conflict, war, battle; poison;
(अम्), n. the fruit of the Śamī tree.

सङ्-गृहीत, अस्, आ, अम्, grasped, seized, caught;
taken, received, accepted, admitted, received kindly;
collected, gathered, comprised, contracted, abridged;
held in, restrained, governed.
—सङ्गृहीत-राष्ट्र,
अस्, m. (a king) who has a well governed kingdom.

सङ्-ग्रहणीय, अस्, आ, अम्, to be seized, &c.;
to be collected; to be drawn together or contracted;
to be restrained, &c.

सङ्घाटिका, f. a pair, couple; a bawd, procuress;
the aquatic plant Trapa Bispinosa (= जल-कण्टक);
smell (= घ्राण).

सङ्-घुष्ट, अस्, आ, अम्, sounded, proclaimed;
resonant, resounding; offered for sale; (अस्), m.
sound, noise, cry.
